24
# Node version target for build environments (CI, developer machines).
# .sps/plan.md pins Node 24 LTS. DianaHost runs Node 20.18.2 (end-of-life) —
# Astro 7 and Vite 8 cannot run there, so the frontend builds in CI only.
# Render reads the FIRST line with semver.validRange(), so the version must be
# line 1 and comments may only follow it (measured: comment-first logged
# "Failed to resolve Node.js version" and fell back to package.json engines).
